@prefix vfr: <https://example.org/vfr#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

# COUNTEREXAMPLE: a concept with a plausible-sounding definition that cites
# no source — exactly what the citation shapes must refuse. The definition
# below is invented, not from the whitepaper. Must fail SHACL.

vfr:Overseer
    a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Overseer" ;
    skos:definition "An Overseer is the component that supervises all Cogs in a Hub and approves their outputs automatically." .
